dev/audit/

# Local-only package status / planning files. Contain unpublished research
# direction (roadmap, parked research track, thesis cross-references) and are
# deliberately not part of the public repo. The pattern is deliberately wider
# than `PSVR_STATUS.md*`: it must also cover PSVR_STATUS_ARCHIVE.md and every
# PSVR_STATUS.md.bak-* backup. Do NOT narrow it, and do NOT relocate either
# file under dev/ — dev/ is tracked apart from dev/audit/, so archiving there
# would publish exactly the content these rules exist to keep private.
PSVR_STATUS*

# Rcpp compiled artefacts (regenerable from src/*.cpp + Rcpp::compileAttributes)
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll
src/symbols.rds

# rmarkdown::render("README.Rmd") writes a preview alongside README.md when
# github_document has html_preview enabled. README.Rmd sets html_preview:
# false so it is no longer produced; this is belt-and-braces, because the file
# reaching the tarball costs an R CMD check NOTE ("Non-standard file/directory
# found at top level").
README.html
